    "updated_at": "2019-03-18T17:11:06Z",
    "body": "Now that said, I don't know whether browsers actually implement that last requirement in their IDL processing.  I know Gecko does not.\r\n\r\nWhat Gecko does implement is that it requires the set of extended attributes on all overloads of a method to be the same.",
